$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=tmccarcl  LOC_AFTER=?

* Closure of the ` car ` field of a machine state (Lean: the type of ` St.car ` ).

s1::id |- ( V e. TMSt -> V e. TMSt )
s2::df-tmcar |- TMcar = ( v e. TMSt |-> ( 1st ` v ) )
s3:s2:a1i |- ( V e. TMSt -> TMcar = ( v e. TMSt |-> ( 1st ` v ) ) )
s4::fveq2 |- ( v = V -> ( 1st ` v ) = ( 1st ` V ) )
s5:s4:adantl |- ( ( V e. TMSt /\ v = V ) -> ( 1st ` v ) = ( 1st ` V ) )
s6::fvexd |- ( V e. TMSt -> ( 1st ` V ) e. _V )
s7:s3,s5,s1,s6:fvmptd |- ( V e. TMSt -> ( TMcar ` V ) = ( 1st ` V ) )
s8::df-tmst |- TMSt = ( 2o X. ( ( 2o |_| 1o ) X. ( ( 2o |_| 1o ) X. ( 2o X. ( 2o X. ( 3o X. 2o ) ) ) ) ) )
s9:s1,s8:eleqtrdi |- ( V e. TMSt -> V e. ( 2o X. ( ( 2o |_| 1o ) X. ( ( 2o |_| 1o ) X. ( 2o X. ( 2o X. ( 3o X. 2o ) ) ) ) ) ) )
i10::xp1st
s11:s9,i10:syl |- ( V e. TMSt -> ( 1st ` V ) e. 2o )
qed:s7,s11:eqeltrd |- ( V e. TMSt -> ( TMcar ` V ) e. 2o )
